      "changelog": "Initial release of Mallary: unified social media publishing API, CLI, and MCP for 10 platforms.\n\n- Create and schedule posts, upload media, and manage jobs across X, Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, YouTube, TikTok, Pinterest, Reddit, Threads, and Snapchat.\n- Unified REST API, CLI (`@mallary/cli`), Managed Control Plane (MCP), and dashboard access.\n- Fetch analytics, manage webhooks, and track publishing status from a single integration.\n- Quick reference for authentication, commands, API endpoints, and supported platforms.\n- Decision guidance for when to use API, CLI, or MCP, plus rate limits per plan.",
